msgid "在帝國邊疆的荒野之中，一群拓荒者建立了一座小小的聚落。"
msgstr "In the wilderness of the empire's frontier, a group of pioneers established a small settlement."

msgid "他們來自不同的背景 —— 有農夫、鐵匠、醫生、商人，甚至是流亡的學者。每個人都帶著自己的故事、個性和夢想來到這裡。"
msgstr "They come from different backgrounds — farmers, blacksmiths, doctors, merchants, even scholars in exile. Each brings their own stories, personalities, and dreams."

msgid "作為這座 <strong>邊境鎮</strong> 的管理者，你需要引導居民們建設家園、發展經濟、抵禦外敵，並見證他們之間的愛恨情仇。"
msgstr "As manager of this <strong>Frontier Town</strong>, you must guide residents to build homes, develop the economy, defend against enemies, and witness their love stories and rivalries."

msgid "「每位居民都是獨立的 AI，擁有自己的思想和意志。你的選擇，將塑造這座鎮的命運。」"
msgstr "\"Every resident is an independent AI with their own thoughts and will. Your choices will shape the fate of this town.\""

msgid "左側的 <strong>像素地圖</strong> 是你的村莊。你可以看到："
msgstr "The <strong>pixel map</strong> on the left is your village. You can see:"

msgid "各種建築 —— 酒館、農場、鐵匠鋪、診所等"
msgstr "Various buildings — tavern, farm, smithy, clinic, etc."

msgid "移動中的居民 —— 他們會自主上班、社交、吃飯、睡覺"
msgstr "Moving residents — they autonomously work, socialize, eat, sleep"

msgid "日夜交替 —— 白天工作，傍晚社交，深夜休息"
msgstr "Day/night cycle — work by day, socialize at dusk, rest at night"

msgid "對話氣泡 —— 居民之間正在進行的交談"
msgstr "Speech bubbles — conversations between residents"

msgid "點擊地圖上的地點可以移動你的角色。"
msgstr "Click locations on the map to move your character."

msgid "右側面板的 <strong>居民</strong> 頁籤顯示所有村民。點擊任一居民可以查看他的詳細資訊。"
msgstr "The <strong>Residents</strong> tab in the right panel shows all villagers. Click any resident to view their details."

msgid "切換到 <strong>聊天</strong> 頁籤，選擇一位居民就可以和他對話！他們會根據自己的個性、心情和對你的好感度來回應。"
msgstr "Switch to the <strong>Chat</strong> tab, select a resident to talk! They respond based on personality, mood, and affinity toward you."

msgid "好感度高的居民會更友善"
msgstr "Residents with high affinity are friendlier"

msgid "你可以選擇自己的職業"
msgstr "You can choose your own job"

msgid "你甚至可以和居民約會、求婚！"
msgstr "You can even date and propose to residents!"

msgid "<strong>經濟</strong> 頁籤可以查看資源、建築、科技樹和貿易。"
msgstr "The <strong>Economy</strong> tab shows resources, buildings, tech tree, and trade."

msgid "<strong>產業</strong> 頁籤管理農場種植、工廠加工和產業發展。"
msgstr "The <strong>Industry</strong> tab manages farming, factory processing, and industry development."

msgid "種植作物、收穫農產品"
msgstr "Plant crops, harvest produce"

msgid "建造工廠加工原料"
msgstr "Build factories to process materials"

msgid "隨著人口增長，城鎮等級提升"
msgstr "Town level increases with population growth"

msgid "完成任務獲得獎勵"
msgstr "Complete quests for rewards"

msgid "遊戲中會發生各種 <strong>隨機事件</strong>："
msgstr "Various <strong>random events</strong> occur in the game:"

msgid "鎮長選舉 —— 投票選出你支持的候選人"
msgstr "Mayor election — vote for your candidate"

msgid "盜匪襲擊 —— 守衛和居民會奮力防禦"
msgstr "Bandit raids — guards and residents fight to defend"

msgid "季節慶典 —— 春祭、仲夏篝火、豐收節、冬至"
msgstr "Seasonal festivals — Spring Festival, Midsummer Bonfire, Harvest Fest, Winter Solstice"

msgid "探索系統 —— 派遣探險隊探索鎮外區域"
msgstr "Exploration — send expeditions to explore areas outside town"

msgid "AI 日報 —— 村莊記者會報導鎮上的大小事"
msgstr "AI Newspaper — village reporter covers town happenings"

msgid "提示：在設定中配置 AI 語言模型（如 Groq 免費），可以讓居民對話更加生動！"
msgstr "Tip: Configure an AI model in Settings (e.g. Groq, free) for more vivid resident conversations!"

