msgstr "Pick someone"

msgid "權重 = 5 ＋ 好感÷10 ＋ 心動÷10；好感低於 −30 的人權重大減。互動後冷卻 6 tick。"
msgstr "Weight = 5 + affinity÷10 + attraction÷10; anyone below −30 affinity is heavily discounted. 6-tick cooldown after each interaction."

msgid "30% 機率先講一則八卦。八卦性格的人一定講，其他人 30%。傳到第 2 手有 40% 會被誇大，20% 的八卦本來就是假的。"
msgstr "30% chance to open with gossip. Gossipy types always do, others 30%. Second-hand gossip is exaggerated 40% of the time, and 20% of it was false to begin with."

msgid "約出去"
msgstr "Hang out"

msgid "好感 ≥ 30 時 12% 機率相約去酒館、公園、廣場、教堂、森林或圖書館；心動 > 40 就算約會。"
msgstr "At affinity ≥ 30 there is a 12% chance to head to the tavern, park, square, church, forest or library; attraction > 40 makes it a date."

msgid "玩家附近的對話由內建 AI 生成（受每日額度限制）；遠處的對話走規則式模板，但同樣寫進記憶。"
msgstr "Chats near the player are generated by the built-in AI (within a daily budget); distant ones use rule-based templates but are still written to memory."

msgid "效果"
msgstr "Effects"

msgid "對話改變雙方好感（−2 到 +5）與心動；正向增幅乘上性格相容度 0.2 到 1.6。約定會寫成「計畫」記憶，情緒波動大就當場改寫今天剩下的行程。"
msgstr "A chat shifts both sides' affinity (−2 to +5) and attraction; positive gains are multiplied by personality compatibility 0.2 to 1.6. Promises become \"plan\" memories, and a big mood swing rewrites the rest of today's schedule on the spot."

msgid "記憶"
msgstr "Memory"

msgid "每人 500 條記憶流。對話寫進「他會記住的那句話」，重要度 4 到 8。"
msgstr "Each villager keeps a 500-entry memory stream. A chat stores \"the line they would remember\", importance 4 to 8."

msgid "反思與計畫"
msgstr "Reflect and plan"

msgid "每晚合成 1 到 2 條想法（跟誰走得近、暗戀、夢想）；每天最多 3 位由 AI 深度反思。清晨依記憶排今日行程。"
msgstr "Every night 1 to 2 insights are synthesized (who they are close to, crushes, dreams); at most 3 villagers a day get AI deep reflection. At dawn the schedule is built from memory."

msgid "情緒敏感"
msgstr "mood sensitivity"

msgid "晚睡"
msgstr "night owl"

msgid "早起"
msgstr "early bird"

msgid "食量"
msgstr "appetite"

msgid "認識 / 陌生人"
msgstr "Acquaintance / stranger"

msgid "每條記憶有時間、類別、內容、重要度（1 到 10）、涉及的人。要說話或做計畫時，不是翻全部，而是用三個分數挑出最該想起的幾條："
msgstr "Every memory has a time, a type, content, importance (1 to 10) and the people involved. When speaking or planning they do not read everything; three scores pick the few most worth recalling:"

msgid "時近"
msgstr "Recency"

msgid "相關"
msgstr "Relevance"

msgid "重要度"
msgstr "Importance"

msgid "已過天數"
msgstr "Days ago"

msgid "，一週前的事只剩三成份量。"
msgstr ", so a week-old event keeps only 30% of its weight."

msgid "內容與當下話題的字元重疊度，加上「有沒有提到眼前這個人」。"
msgstr "character overlap between the content and the current topic, plus whether it mentions the person in front of them."

msgid "表白、絕交、劈腿這類事件是 8 到 10；日常觀察只有 2。"
msgstr "confessions, fallouts and cheating score 8 to 10; everyday observations only 2."

msgid "相關程度"
msgstr "Relevance"

msgid "性格參數"
msgstr "Personality parameters"

msgid "每人出生時抽 3 個特質（互斥的不會同時出現），加上 1 到 3 個價值觀。特質決定社交加成、工作效率、基礎心情、情緒敏感度與戀愛傾向。"
msgstr "Everyone is born with 3 traits (mutually exclusive ones never co-occur) plus 1 to 3 values. Traits set social bonuses, work efficiency, baseline mood, emotional sensitivity and romantic tendency."

msgid "價值觀"
msgstr "Values"

msgid "相容度"
msgstr "Compatibility"

msgid "善良配善良、魅力配害羞、沉穩配神經質會加分；刻薄配害羞、樂觀配悲觀、懶惰配勤勞會扣分。換算成 0.2 到 1.6 的倍率，乘在每次好感增幅上。"
msgstr "Kind with kind, charming with shy, calm with neurotic score bonus points; mean with shy, optimist with pessimist, lazy with diligent lose points. It becomes a 0.2 to 1.6 multiplier on every affinity gain."

msgid "六項需求"
msgstr "Six needs"

msgid "飢餓、休息、社交、舒適、娛樂、美感。白天每 tick 飢餓 −2、休息 −1.5、社交 −1；夜裡衰減放慢。任一項見底就拖累心情，心情又決定他今天想不想理人。"
msgstr "Hunger, rest, social, comfort, fun, beauty. By day each tick costs hunger −2, rest −1.5, social −1; decay slows at night. Any need hitting bottom drags mood down, and mood decides whether they feel like talking today."

msgid "關係階梯"
msgstr "Relationship ladder"

msgid "對每個人各記三個數：好感（−100 到 100）、信任、心動（0 到 100）。好感決定稱呼，心動超過 50 就是暗戀。"
msgstr "Three numbers per person: affinity (−100 to 100), trust and attraction (0 to 100). Affinity sets the label; attraction above 50 is a crush."

msgid "50 tick 沒互動，好感每天往 0 漂 0.8；情侶夫妻只漂 0.3。"
msgstr "After 50 ticks without contact, affinity drifts toward 0 by 0.8 a day; couples and spouses only 0.3."

msgid "好感 > 20 且互動超過 3 次，相配的人每天 45% 機率心動 +1 到 +5；高好感高相配還有 6% 的「來電火花」+8 到 +16。"
msgstr "Above 20 affinity and 3+ interactions, compatible pairs have a 45% daily chance of +1 to +5 attraction; high affinity plus high compatibility adds a 6% \"spark\" of +8 to +16."

msgid "雙方好感 ≤ −35：每隔 5 天 15% 機率在廣場對嗆；雙方 ≤ −60：正式絕交，觸發劇情名場面。"
msgstr "Mutual affinity ≤ −35: every 5 days a 15% chance of a shouting match in the square; ≤ −60: an official fallout that triggers a drama scene."

msgid "聽到自己被造謠會當面對質，造謠者好感 −12；紅娘式八卦會讓兩位當事人開始注意彼此。"
msgstr "Hearing a rumor about yourself leads to a confrontation and −12 affinity for the gossip; matchmaking gossip makes the two people notice each other."

msgid "戲劇導演每天看一眼全鎮：太平靜就悄悄推一把暗戀、舊帳或吃醋。"
msgstr "A drama director checks the whole town daily: if things are too quiet it nudges a crush, an old grudge or some jealousy."

msgid "想法與心情"
msgstr "Thoughts and mood"

msgid "事件會留下有期限的「想法」，直接加減心情，有些還會改變對當事人的看法："
msgstr "Events leave time-limited \"thoughts\" that add to or subtract from mood, and some change how they see the people involved:"

msgid "持續天數"
msgstr "Days"

msgid "對人看法"
msgstr "Opinion"

msgid "成本閘門：只有玩家附近的對話與每日額度內的行程／反思會呼叫 AI，其餘一律規則式運算，所以一整鎮 20 多人同時「活著」也不會燒錢。"
msgstr "Cost gate: only chats near the player and schedules/reflection within the daily budget call the AI; everything else is rule-based, so a whole town of 20+ villagers stays \"alive\" without burning money."

