msgstr "Never heard of it."

msgid "欸你這麼一說我好像有印象...不過我也不確定是不是真的。"
msgstr "Now that you mention it, rings a bell... but not sure it's true."

msgid "這個嘛...我真的不知道欸。"
msgstr "Well... I really don't know."

