msgstr "Try the library?"

msgid "我也想知道呢。"
msgstr "I'd like to know too."

msgid "有趣的問題！"
msgstr "Interesting question!"

msgid "讓我想想...不，我真的不知道。"
msgstr "Let me think... no, I really don't know."

msgid "一些事。"
msgstr " about something."

msgid "你突然這樣問我..."
msgstr "Asking me that out of the blue..."

msgid "可能吧？"
msgstr "Maybe?"

msgid "嗯...這個嘛..."
msgstr "Hmm... well..."

msgid "好問題..."
msgstr "Good question..."

msgid "我也不太確定。"
msgstr "I'm not sure either."

msgid "我想想喔..."
msgstr "Let me think..."

msgid "我沒想過這個問題欸。"
msgstr "Never thought about that."

msgid "要看情況。"
msgstr "Depends."

msgid "你為什麼會想問這個？"
msgstr "Why do you ask?"

msgid "哈哈，你真的很好奇欸！"
msgstr "Haha, you're really curious!"

msgid "我回去想想再告訴你。"
msgstr "Let me think it over and tell you later."

msgid "說實話我不太清楚。"
msgstr "Honestly I'm not sure."

msgid "這種事你自己不知道嗎？"
msgstr "Don't you know that yourself?"

msgid "嗯，我覺得答案應該是正面的！"
msgstr "Hmm, I think the answer is positive!"

msgid "我不確定，但大概不會太好吧..."
msgstr "Not sure, but probably not great..."

msgid "我沒有什麼特別的想法欸。"
msgstr "No particular thoughts."

msgid "一個問題。"
msgstr " a question."

msgid "你說的我都聽進去了。"
msgstr "I heard every word."

msgid "嗯嗯，我在聽。你繼續說。"
msgstr "Mm-hm, I'm listening. Go on."

msgid "是嗎？跟我說更多。"
msgstr "Is that so? Tell me more."

msgid "哈哈，你說的我懂。"
msgstr "Haha, I get what you mean."

msgid "嗯嗯！然後呢？"
msgstr "Mm-hm! And then?"

msgid "我也有同感！"
msgstr "I feel the same!"

msgid "是嗎？有意思！跟我說更多。"
msgstr "Really? Interesting! Tell me more."

msgid "原來如此，我沒想過這件事。"
msgstr "I see, I never thought of that."

msgid "哈，你還挺有想法的嘛。"
msgstr "Ha, you've got ideas."

msgid "嗯，你說的有道理。"
msgstr "Hmm, fair point."

msgid "是喔？有趣。"
msgstr "Oh? Interesting."

msgid "你這人還挺愛聊的。"
msgstr "You do like to talk."

msgid "哦，我知道了。"
msgstr "Oh, I see."

msgid "嗯...是嗎。"
msgstr "Hmm... is that so."

msgid "嗯嗯..."
msgstr "Mm-hm..."

msgid "好吧。"
msgstr "Okay."

msgid "所以呢？"
msgstr "So?"

