msgstr " ...(stomach growls) Ah, excuse me."

msgid " 哎，跟你聊著聊著都忘了吃飯了。"
msgstr " Oh, I forgot to eat while chatting with you."

msgid " 話說酒館現在有什麼吃的嗎？我都沒吃午飯。"
msgstr " By the way, does the tavern have anything now? I skipped lunch."

msgid " 不好意思，我眼皮有點撐不住了..."
msgstr " Sorry, my eyelids are getting heavy..."

msgid " 唉，今天腰都快斷了，幹了一整天活。"
msgstr " Ugh, my back is killing me after working all day."

msgid " （打了個哈欠）抱歉...昨晚沒睡好。"
msgstr " (yawns) Sorry... didn't sleep well last night."

msgid " 啊，都這個時間了？我得回去了。"
msgstr " Ah, is it that late already? I should head back."

msgid " 好了，夜深了，明天再聊吧。"
msgstr " Alright, it's late, let's talk tomorrow."

msgid " 今晚的星空真美，你不覺得嗎？"
msgstr " The stars are beautiful tonight, don't you think?"

msgid " 欸你看！那邊那顆星特別亮！"
msgstr " Hey look! That star over there is really bright!"

