msgstr "Ah... th-thank you... (blushing)"

msgid "真的嗎？（開心但不好意思）"
msgstr "Really? (happy but embarrassed)"

msgid "你有什麼目的？"
msgstr "What are you after?"

msgid "哼，不用奉承我。"
msgstr "Hmph, no need to flatter me."

msgid "嗯，我知道。"
msgstr "Yes, I know."

msgid "你真會說話！"
msgstr "You've got a way with words!"

