msgstr "A compliment like that is a little embarrassing."

msgid "別客氣，鄰居互相幫忙是應該的。"
msgstr "Of course, neighbors help each other."

msgid "我能做的一定幫！你說吧。"
msgstr "If I can help, I will! Go ahead."

msgid "需要幫忙嗎？儘管說！"
msgstr "Need help? Just say so!"

msgid "嗯...看是什麼事吧。我今天有點懶..."
msgstr "Hmm... depends what it is. Feeling lazy today..."

msgid "幫忙可以，但別太累的。"
msgstr "I can help, as long as it's not too tiring."

msgid "你自己不能解決嗎？"
msgstr "Can't you handle it yourself?"

msgid "我不是慈善機構。"
msgstr "I'm not a charity."

msgid "看什麼事吧。"
msgstr "Depends what it is."

msgid "什麼事？看我能不能幫上忙。"
msgstr "What is it? Let's see if I can help."

msgid "好吧，你說說看。"
msgstr "Alright, tell me."

msgid "我盡量吧。"
msgstr "I'll do what I can."

msgid "求助。"
msgstr " for help."

msgid "下次再來找我。"
msgstr "Come find me again."

msgid "嗯...早點回來。"
msgstr "Mm... come back soon."

msgid "這麼快就走？路上小心。想你。"
msgstr "Leaving so soon? Take care. I'll miss you."

msgid "再見！下次再聊！"
msgstr "Bye! Let's talk again!"

msgid "好的，有空再來找我！"
msgstr "Okay, come see me when you're free!"

msgid "掰掰，保重啊！"
msgstr "Bye-bye, take care!"

msgid "嗯，再見。"
msgstr "Mm, goodbye."

msgid "好的。"
msgstr "Okay."

msgid "拜拜。"
msgstr "Bye."

msgid "終於要走了。"
msgstr "Finally leaving."

msgid "道別了。"
msgstr " said goodbye."

