msgid "曾是軍官，二十年前定居邊境鎮。他深愛這個社區，把全鎮的安危視為自己的責任。"
msgstr "A former officer who settled in Frontier Town twenty years ago. He loves this community and treats the whole town's safety as his own responsibility."

msgid "才華洋溢的醫生，離開城裡的大醫院來到邊境鎮行醫。經常工作到深夜。"
msgstr "A gifted doctor who left a big city hospital to practice in Frontier Town. Often works late into the night."

msgid "沉默寡言但技藝精湛的鐵匠，用金屬表達自己的情感。私下喜歡寫詩。"
msgstr "A quiet but masterful blacksmith who expresses his feelings through metal. Secretly writes poetry."

msgid "酒館的靈魂人物，認識鎮上每一個人，也知道所有人的八卦。煮的菜讓人回味無窮。"
msgstr "The soul of the tavern; knows everyone in town and all their gossip. Her cooking is unforgettable."

msgid "有著遠大夢想的年輕農夫。偷偷寫情書但從未寄出，心中暗戀著某人。"
msgstr "A young farmer with big dreams. Secretly writes love letters he never sends, nursing a crush."

msgid "精明的女商人，與外面的世界有廣泛的聯繫。表面開朗但內心悲觀。"
msgstr "A shrewd businesswoman with wide connections to the outside world. Cheerful on the surface, pessimistic underneath."

msgid "前傭兵，在邊境鎮找到了平靜。但嫉妒心很重，尤其在感情方面。"
msgstr "A former mercenary who found peace in Frontier Town. Deeply jealous, especially in matters of the heart."

msgid "聰明但容易焦慮的年輕學者，正在研究小鎮附近的古代遺跡。"
msgstr "A bright but anxious young scholar studying the ancient ruins near town."

msgid "從十六歲就開始挖礦的老礦工。說話粗魯但非常可靠。"
msgstr "An old miner who has dug since he was sixteen. Rough-spoken but utterly reliable."

msgid "溫柔的牧師，照顧禮拜堂和居民的心靈。有一副動人的歌喉，經常在教堂唱歌。"
msgstr "A gentle priest who tends the chapel and the residents' hearts. Has a moving voice and often sings in church."

msgid "迷人的懶鬼，比起幹活更喜歡講故事。但只要認真起來手藝一流。"
msgstr "A charming slacker who prefers telling stories to working. But when he gets serious, his craftsmanship is first-rate."

msgid "鎮上最年輕的居民。天賦異稟的裁縫師，但太害羞不敢接受別人的誇獎。"
msgstr "The youngest resident in town. A prodigiously talented tailor, too shy to accept a compliment."

msgid "從遠方來的遊唱商人，帶著一把舊吉他和說不完的故事。走到哪都是焦點，也走到哪都留下心碎的人。"
msgstr "A wandering merchant-minstrel from afar with an old guitar and endless stories. The center of attention wherever he goes, leaving broken hearts behind."

msgid "沉穩可靠的老木匠，和妻子何秀結縭二十年。話不多，但眼裡總有妻子的身影。"
msgstr "A steady, reliable old carpenter, married to Sandra for twenty years. A man of few words whose eyes always follow his wife."

msgid "何昌的妻子，開朗愛笑。和王麗是廚房裡的死黨，兩人湊在一起整條街的八卦都藏不住。"
msgstr "Charles's wife, cheerful and quick to laugh. Best kitchen buddies with Lily; together no gossip on the street stays hidden."

msgid "孤僻的年輕天才，總是埋首書堆。最近卻常常為了一個人心神不寧，連公式都算錯。"
msgstr "A reclusive young genius always buried in books. Lately distracted by one particular person, even botching her formulas."

msgid "剛搬來的糕點師傅，笑起來像陽光。她的甜點總在清晨飄香，也悄悄記住了某個早起農夫的身影。"
msgstr "A newly arrived pastry chef with a smile like sunshine. Her sweets scent the dawn, and she has quietly noticed a certain early-rising farmer."

msgid "吳達的舊袍澤，退伍後追隨老友來到邊境鎮。剛硬耿直,看不慣楊鋒的作風,卻對禮拜堂的歌聲莫名心軟。"
msgstr "Duncan's old comrade-in-arms who followed his friend to Frontier Town after service. Hard and blunt, he can't stand Felix's ways, yet softens inexplicably at the chapel's singing."

msgid "遊歷各地的繡藝師，指尖有星光。愛自由不受拘束，卻在遇見一位安靜的星象學者後,第一次想為誰停下腳步。"
msgstr "A well-traveled embroiderer with starlight in her fingertips. Loves her freedom, yet after meeting a quiet stargazer, for the first time she wants to stay."

msgid "沉靜的星象研究者，總在夜裡觀測。話不多,但每次抬頭看見那位繡藝師,筆記本上的星圖就會多幾筆走神的線條。"
msgstr "A quiet astronomer who observes by night. Says little, but whenever she looks up and sees that embroiderer, a few distracted lines appear on her star charts."

msgid "跑了四十年船的老船長，退下來當港務長。嗓門大心腸軟，全鎮的船都經過他的手。年輕時和廟祝雲姨有過一段沒說完的故事。"
msgstr "An old captain who sailed for forty years before becoming harbormaster. Loud voice, soft heart; every boat in town has passed through his hands. In his youth he and the shrine keeper Claudia had a story left unfinished."

msgid "天不亮就出海的討海青年，蚵田和漁獲都靠他。曬得黝黑，笑起來一口白牙。每天收工都繞去海味居，只為看掌杓的小鷗一眼。"
msgstr "A young fisherman out at sea before dawn; the oyster beds and the catch depend on him. Sun-dark with a bright white grin. Every day after work he swings by the Sea Kitchen just to glimpse Gwen at the stove."

msgid "海味居的掌杓姑娘，一手海鮮料理讓過路商人特地繞港。開朗愛笑，渾然不覺兩個男人都在偷偷看她。"
msgstr "The cook at the Sea Kitchen, whose seafood makes passing merchants detour into port. Cheerful and quick to laugh, blissfully unaware that two men are secretly watching her."

msgid "跑船帶貨的老江湖，南北雜貨行的貨都是他捎回來的。嘴上沒把門，外地的八卦比報紙還快。和補帆的秀姑是老夫老妻。"
msgstr "An old hand who ships goods by boat; everything in the general store came back with him. No filter on his mouth, faster with foreign gossip than any newspaper. Long married to the sailmaker Shirley."

msgid "補了三十年帆的巧手，鎮上人的衣裳也全是她做的。和浪叔鬥了半輩子嘴，針線一拿起來誰都不理。"
msgstr "Deft hands that have mended sails for thirty years; every garment in town is hers too. Has bickered with Wade half her life, but once needle and thread are in hand she ignores everyone."

msgid "鹽場的老鹽工，沉默得像塊礁石。二十年前一場船難後，就和燈塔的燈爺再沒說過一句話——沒人知道那晚發生了什麼。"
msgstr "An old salt worker as silent as a reef. Since a shipwreck twenty years ago he hasn't spoken a word to Lou at the lighthouse. Nobody knows what happened that night."

msgid "守了半輩子燈塔的老人，夜裡點燈、白天睡覺，和全鎮作息相反。書房堆滿航海日誌。提到石叔，他只會把燈芯撥得更亮。"
msgstr "An old man who has kept the lighthouse half his life, lighting the lamp by night and sleeping by day, opposite to the whole town. His study is piled with ship logs. Mention Stan and he only trims the wick brighter."

msgid "海女出身的醫師，潛得比誰都深，也把診療所打理得一塵不染。誰家被海膽扎了、被日頭曬昏了，都是她救的。和小鷗是無話不談的手帕交。"
msgstr "A doctor who started as a diver, dives deeper than anyone and keeps the clinic spotless. Sea urchin spines, sunstroke, she has treated it all. Gwen's closest confidante."

msgid "修船工房的鐵匠，錨鏈和船釘都出自他的爐子。話少手巧，打鐵的節奏永遠穩。只有小鷗送飯來的時候，鎚子才會敲歪。"
msgstr "The blacksmith at the boatwright's shed; every anchor chain and ship nail comes from his forge. Few words, skilled hands, a steady hammer rhythm that only falters when Gwen brings lunch."

msgid "海神小廟的廟祝，出海的人都來求她一炷平安香。溫柔健談，只有海伯經過廟前時，她會突然想不起下一句經文。"
msgstr "Keeper of the Sea God Shrine, where every sailor comes for a blessing before setting out. Gentle and talkative, except when Hal passes the shrine and she suddenly forgets the next line of the sutra."

msgid "望潮哨的哨長，颱風天全鎮聽他的哨音行動。責任感重但佔有慾也重，看誰跟阿汐多說兩句話都不順眼。"
msgstr "Chief of the Tidewatch Post; in a typhoon the whole town moves to his whistle. Deeply responsible but deeply possessive, glaring at anyone who talks to Marina too long."

msgid "船木匠，手藝一流但三天打魚兩天曬網——字面意義上的。最愛躺在曬網場講他「差點抓到人魚」的故事。"
msgstr "A ship's carpenter with first-rate skills who works three days and lounges two, literally. Loves lying in the net yard telling the story of how he \"almost caught a mermaid\"."

msgid "研究潮汐與洋流的年輕學者，筆記本永遠算不完。緊張起來會語無倫次，只有看海的時候是平靜的。"
msgstr "A young scholar of tides and currents whose notebooks are never finished. Babbles when nervous; only calm when watching the sea."

msgid "蚵田的少年，話少得像蚵殼。每天默默把最好的海菜留在珊珊的窗台上，從來不敢署名。"
msgstr "A boy from the oyster beds, as quiet as an oyster shell. Every day he leaves the best seaweed on Coral's windowsill, never daring to sign his name."

msgid "鎮上最老的海女退休後在海味居幫廚，醃的魚乾是傳家手藝。誰家的曾祖父年輕時暗戀過誰，她都記得。"
msgstr "The town's oldest diver, now helping in the Sea Kitchen; her cured fish is a family art. She remembers whose great-grandfather had a crush on whom."

msgid "明明分了,見面卻還是躲躲閃閃...是還沒放下嗎?"
msgstr "They broke up, yet still dodge each other when they meet... not over it yet?"

msgid "好像都對"
msgstr " both seem interested in "

msgid "有意思,這下有得瞧了。"
msgstr ". This should be interesting."

msgid "的樑子結很久了,一見面就火藥味十足。"
msgstr " have held a grudge for ages; sparks fly whenever they meet."

msgid "聽說孫雨最近老往診所跑,林美醫生好像也不排斥她的陪伴...倒是守衛楊鋒的臉色越來越難看。"
msgstr "Nora keeps visiting the clinic lately, and Dr. Mia doesn't seem to mind her company... meanwhile guard Felix's face grows darker by the day."

msgid "新來的高朗是吳達的老袍澤,一來就跟楊鋒針鋒相對...酒館的火藥味濃得化不開。"
msgstr "Newcomer Lance is Duncan's old comrade and butted heads with Felix from day one... the tavern air is thick with tension."

msgid "糕點師傅蘇晴的早餐總幫劉俊多留一份,可劉俊的心思好像還在許瑩身上...這下有得瞧了。"
msgstr "Pastry chef Sunny always saves an extra breakfast for Leo, but Leo's heart still seems set on Ivy... this should be interesting."

msgid "遊戲讀取成功！"
msgstr "Game loaded!"

msgid "——"
msgstr " — "

msgid "一支風塵僕僕的商隊在鎮口停下,領隊朝你眨眨眼。"
msgstr "A dusty caravan halts at the town gate and its leader winks at you."

msgid "旅行商隊經過"
msgstr "Passing caravan"

msgid "稀有貨物讓全鎮眼睛發亮,士氣大振。"
msgstr "The rare goods make the whole town's eyes light up; morale soars."

msgid "花 40 銀幣,換來全鎮的好心情與糧食"
msgstr "Spend 40 silver for food and a town-wide mood boost"

msgid "買下稀有貨物"
msgstr "Buy the rare goods"

msgid "一位新居民決定在邊境鎮落腳。"
msgstr "A new resident decides to settle in Frontier Town."

msgid "招募新血"
msgstr "Recruit new blood"

msgid "說服一位旅人留下來定居"
msgstr "Convince a traveler to settle here"

msgid "之間,似乎有什麼悄悄萌芽了。"
msgstr ", something seems to be quietly blossoming."

msgid "可惜鎮上沒有適合的單身男女。"
msgstr "Sadly there are no suitable singles in town."

msgid "商隊帶來遠方的風流韻事…也撩動了鎮上某兩顆心"
msgstr "The caravan brings romantic tales from afar... and stirs two hearts in town"

msgid "打聽消息"
msgstr "Ask around"

msgid "一位蒙面旅人留下一句祝禱,便消失在暮色裡。"
msgstr "A masked traveler leaves a blessing and vanishes into the dusk."

msgid "神秘旅人的祝福"
msgstr "Mysterious traveler's blessing"

msgid "一股迷人的氣質,悄悄籠罩了全鎮。"
msgstr "A charming aura quietly settles over the town."

msgid "全鎮居民魅力 +1"
msgstr "All residents charm +1"

msgid "魅力之祝"
msgstr "Blessing of Charm"

msgid "全鎮居民膽識 +1"
msgstr "All residents courage +1"

msgid "居民們的眼神,多了幾分堅定。"
msgstr "A new resolve shows in the residents' eyes."

msgid "膽識之祝"
msgstr "Blessing of Courage"

msgid "全鎮居民智慧 +1"
msgstr "All residents wisdom +1"

msgid "智慧之祝"
msgstr "Blessing of Wisdom"

msgid "鎮上彷彿一夜之間開了竅。"
msgstr "The whole town seems to wise up overnight."

msgid "今年收成不錯,穀倉滿溢。該怎麼運用這份餘裕?"
msgstr "A good harvest this year and the granary overflows. How to use the surplus?"

msgid "豐收的抉擇"
msgstr "Harvest decision"

msgid "囤積過冬"
msgstr "Stockpile for winter"

msgid "把餘糧全存起來(+40 糧食)"
msgstr "Store all the surplus (+40 food)"

msgid "穀倉裝得滿滿當當,過冬不愁了。"
msgstr "The granary is packed; winter holds no worries."

msgid "全鎮同歡(-15 糧食,士氣大漲)"
msgstr "Town-wide celebration (-15 food, big morale boost)"

msgid "大辦豐收宴"
msgstr "Throw a harvest feast"

msgid "豐收宴的笑聲響徹整條街。"
msgstr "Laughter from the harvest feast rings down the street."

msgid "換成現金(-20 糧食,+30 銀幣)"
msgstr "Convert to cash (-20 food, +30 silver)"

msgid "賣給商人"
msgstr "Sell to merchants"

msgid "餘糧換成了沉甸甸的銀幣。"
msgstr "The surplus turned into a heavy purse of silver."

msgid "一則來路不明的傳聞在鎮上流竄,你要怎麼撥弄這把火?"
msgstr "A rumor of unknown origin is spreading through town. How will you stoke the fire?"

msgid "謠言的火種"
msgstr "Spark of rumor"

msgid "在你的推波助瀾下,"
msgstr "With your nudging, "

msgid "撮合一對有緣人"
msgstr "Match a likely pair"

msgid "沒有適合湊對的人。"
msgstr "No suitable pair to match."

msgid "走得更近了。"
msgstr " grew closer."

msgid "順水推舟"
msgstr "Go with the flow"

msgid "因為這則謠言結下了樑子。"
msgstr " fell out over the rumor."

msgid "挑撥離間"
msgstr "Sow discord"

msgid "沒能挑起什麼事端。"
