msgid "「邊境小館」正式開張！王麗的手藝讓路過的商人都驚豔不已。"
msgstr "The \"Frontier Bistro\" is open! Lily's cooking amazes every passing merchant."

msgid "如果有一天我能開間餐館就好了..."
msgstr "If only I could open a restaurant someday..."

msgid "新的貿易路線"
msgstr "A new trade route"

msgid "趙霞聽說山的另一邊有個繁華的城鎮，想開拓新的貿易路線..."
msgstr "Zoe heard of a bustling town beyond the mountains and wants to open a new trade route..."

msgid "一起去探路"
msgstr "Scout the route together"

msgid "準備 40 食物做路糧"
msgstr "Prepare 40 food for the road"

msgid "趙霞好感度達到 50"
msgstr "Reach 50 affinity with Zoe"

msgid "資助她"
msgstr "Fund her"

msgid "提供 150 銀幣資金"
msgstr "Provide 150 silver in funding"

msgid "新的貿易路線開通了！商人們開始更頻繁地造訪邊境鎮。"
msgstr "The new trade route is open! Merchants visit Frontier Town more often."

msgid "你有沒有想過，山的另一邊會是什麼樣子？"
msgstr "Ever wondered what lies beyond the mountains?"

msgid "守衛的訓練"
msgstr "Guard training"

msgid "楊鋒想組織一支像樣的巡邏隊，保護小鎮的安全..."
msgstr "Felix wants to organize a proper patrol to keep the town safe..."

msgid "一起訓練"
msgstr "Train together"

msgid "提供 15 金屬做訓練武器"
msgstr "Provide 15 metal for training weapons"

msgid "與楊鋒訓練 4 次"
msgstr "Train with Felix 4 times"

msgid "巡邏隊成立了！楊鋒信心滿滿地說：「這下沒人敢來鬧事了。」"
msgstr "The patrol is formed! Felix says confidently: \"Nobody will dare cause trouble now.\""

msgid "光靠我一個人守不住整個鎮子啊..."
msgstr "I can't guard the whole town alone..."

msgid "楊鋒的新武器"
msgstr "Felix's new weapon"

msgid "聽說張豪練成了傳說級的鑄劍術，楊鋒想請他打一把好武器..."
msgstr "Hearing Hugo mastered legendary swordsmithing, Felix wants him to forge a fine weapon..."

msgid "幫他牽線"
msgstr "Make the introduction"

msgid "張豪好感度達到 40"
msgstr "Reach 40 affinity with Hugo"

msgid "提供 20 金屬做材料"
msgstr "Provide 20 metal as material"

msgid "楊鋒拿到新武器，激動地舞了一套劍法。「有了這把劍，誰來都不怕！」"
msgstr "Felix receives the weapon and swings through a sword form in delight. \"With this blade, let them come!\""

msgid "聽說張豪最近在研究什麼新的鍛造技術？"
msgstr "I hear Hugo is working on some new forging technique?"

msgid "古代遺跡的線索"
msgstr "Clues to the ancient ruins"

msgid "孫雨在研究中發現了關於附近古代遺跡的線索..."
msgstr "Nora's research uncovered clues about the ancient ruins nearby..."

msgid "一起調查"
msgstr "Investigate together"

msgid "提供 50 銀幣研究經費"
msgstr "Provide 50 silver in research funds"

msgid "與孫雨討論發現 5 次"
msgstr "Discuss findings with Nora 5 times"

msgid "你們發現了古代文明的遺跡！孫雨興奮得手都在抖。「這是改寫歷史的發現！」"
msgstr "You discovered the ruins of an ancient civilization! Nora's hands tremble with excitement. \"This rewrites history!\""

msgid "最近我在北邊的山洞裡發現了一些奇怪的符號..."
msgstr "I found strange symbols in a cave to the north..."

msgid "建造圖書館"
msgstr "Build a library"

msgid "孫雨希望建一座圖書館，保存所有的研究成果和知識..."
msgstr "Nora hopes to build a library to preserve all research and knowledge..."

msgid "幫他建圖書館"
msgstr "Help build the library"

msgid "提供 80 木材"
msgstr "Provide 80 wood"

msgid "提供 40 石材"
msgstr "Provide 40 stone"

msgid "提供 60 銀幣"
msgstr "Provide 60 silver"

msgid "圖書館建成了！孫雨小心翼翼地把書一本本擺上書架。「知識是最珍貴的財富。」"
msgstr "The library is built! Nora carefully shelves the books one by one. \"Knowledge is the most precious wealth.\""

msgid "這些研究成果如果沒有好好保存，太可惜了..."
msgstr "It would be a shame if this research weren't properly preserved..."

msgid "重建神龕"
msgstr "Rebuild the shrine"

msgid "黃莉想在鎮上重建一座被風暴摧毀的古老神龕..."
msgstr "Hazel wants to rebuild an ancient shrine destroyed by a storm..."

msgid "幫她重建"
msgstr "Help her rebuild"

msgid "提供 25 石材"
msgstr "Provide 25 stone"

msgid "提供 15 木材"
msgstr "Provide 15 wood"

msgid "與黃莉祈禱 3 次"
msgstr "Pray with Hazel 3 times"

msgid "神龕重建完成。黃莉在晨光中虔誠祈禱：「願這片土地上的所有人都平安。」"
msgstr "The shrine is rebuilt. Hazel prays in the morning light: \"May everyone on this land be safe.\""

msgid "那座被毀的老神龕...我一直想把它修好。"
msgstr "That ruined old shrine... I've always wanted to restore it."

msgid "豐收祭典"
msgstr "Harvest rite"

msgid "黃莉想舉辦一場傳統的豐收祭典，祈求來年風調雨順..."
msgstr "Hazel wants to hold a traditional harvest rite to pray for good weather next year..."

msgid "幫她準備祭典"
msgstr "Help prepare the rite"

msgid "準備 80 食物做祭品"
msgstr "Prepare 80 food as offerings"

msgid "支付 40 銀幣買裝飾"
msgstr "Pay 40 silver for decorations"

msgid "邀請至少 6 位鎮民參加"
msgstr "Invite at least 6 townsfolk"

msgid "豐收祭典圓滿成功！鎮民們載歌載舞，其樂融融。"
msgstr "The harvest rite is a success! The townsfolk sing and dance in joy."

msgid "如果能辦一場豐收祭典，大家的心情一定會好很多..."
msgstr "A harvest rite would lift everyone's spirits..."

msgid "千年古木的傳說"
msgstr "Legend of the thousand-year tree"

msgid "馬強說北山有一棵千年古木，用它的木材可以打造傳世之作..."
msgstr "Max says a thousand-year-old tree stands on the north mountain; its wood could make a masterpiece for the ages..."

msgid "一起去北山"
msgstr "Go to the north mountain together"

msgid "準備 30 食物做路糧"
msgstr "Prepare 30 food for the road"

msgid "馬強好感度達到 65"
msgstr "Reach 65 affinity with Max"

msgid "你們找到了傳說中的千年古木！馬強如獲至寶地撫摸著木材。"
msgstr "You found the legendary tree! Max strokes the wood like a treasure."

msgid "有件事...我年輕時在北山發現過一棵千年古木..."
msgstr "There's something... when I was young I found a thousand-year tree on the north mountain..."

msgid "馬強的工坊"
msgstr "Max's workshop"

msgid "馬強想建一座專業的木工工坊，提升全鎮的建設能力..."
msgstr "Max wants to build a proper carpentry workshop to boost the town's construction..."

msgid "幫他建工坊"
msgstr "Help build the workshop"

msgid "提供 100 木材"
msgstr "Provide 100 wood"

msgid "提供 15 金屬做工具"
msgstr "Provide 15 metal for tools"

msgid "馬強的工坊建成了！全鎮的建設速度都提升了。"
msgstr "Max's workshop is built! Construction across town speeds up."

msgid "如果有一間正式的工坊，我能做出更好的東西..."
msgstr "With a proper workshop I could make much better things..."

msgid "馬強（木匠）"
msgstr "Max (carpenter)"

msgid "透露哪片森林木材最好"
msgstr "Reveals which forest has the best timber"

msgid "教你辨認木材品種（硬木採集捷徑）"
msgstr "Teaches you to identify wood types (hardwood shortcut)"

msgid "千年古木支線任務"
msgstr "Thousand-year tree side quest"

msgid "自願當伐木場主管"
msgstr "Volunteers to run the lumber camp"

msgid "傳說工具——「這把斧頭跟了我一輩子，現在交給你。」"
msgstr "Legendary tool: \"This axe has been with me my whole life. Now it's yours.\""

msgid "吳達（礦工）"
msgstr "Duncan (miner)"

msgid "告訴你哪裡有好石頭"
msgstr "Tells you where the good stone is"

msgid "大理石礦脈任務"
msgstr "Marble vein quest"

msgid "帶你去秘密礦脈"
msgstr "Takes you to a secret vein"

msgid "劉俊（農夫）"
msgstr "Leo (farmer)"

msgid "分享種植技巧"
msgstr "Shares planting tips"

msgid "自動幫你照顧農田"
msgstr "Tends your fields automatically"

msgid "張豪（鐵匠）"
msgstr "Hugo (blacksmith)"

msgid "打造工具品質更高"
msgstr "Forges higher-quality tools"

msgid "開放大師級鍛造"
msgstr "Unlocks master forging"

msgid "趙霞（商人）"
msgstr "Zoe (merchant)"

msgid "交易價格優惠"
msgstr "Better trade prices"

msgid "打開商人網絡"
msgstr "Opens the merchant network"

msgid "的個人任務"
msgstr "'s personal quest"

msgid "已觸發"
msgstr "triggered"

msgid "似乎有事情想找人幫忙"
msgstr " seems to need help with something"

msgid "任務獎勵"
msgstr "Quest reward"

msgid "的心願"
msgstr "'s wish"

msgid "達成了"
msgstr " achieved "

msgid "的好感度效果"
msgstr "'s affinity effect"

msgid "你目前有一個未完成的心願"
msgstr "You have an unfinished wish"

msgid "你因為和玩家的關係好"
msgstr "Because of your good relationship with the player"

msgid "儲備 80 木材"
msgstr "Stockpile 80 wood"

msgid "說服林美教你草藥知識，用智慧過冬。"
msgstr "Convince Mia to teach you herbal lore and winter on wits."

msgid "林美好感度達到 40"
msgstr "Reach 40 affinity with Mia"

msgid "與居民交談 8 次"
msgstr "Talk with residents 8 times"

msgid "建造基礎設施來抵禦寒冬。"
msgstr "Build infrastructure to withstand the winter."

msgid "完成 2 座建築"
msgstr "Complete 2 buildings"

msgid "開啟 1 個產業"
msgstr "Open 1 industry"

msgid "小鎮平安度過了第一個冬天！你的努力沒有白費。"
msgstr "The town made it through its first winter! Your effort paid off."

msgid "冬天快到了，得做點準備。你可以多囤點物資，或者找林醫生聊聊。"
msgstr "Winter is coming; time to prepare. Stock up on supplies, or talk to Dr. Mia."

msgid "如果你有興趣，我可以教你一些草藥的知識...對過冬很有幫助。"
msgstr "If you're interested, I can teach you some herbal lore... it helps a lot in winter."

msgid "你要是能幫我找些種子，我教你怎麼種東西。"
msgstr "Find me some seeds and I'll teach you how to grow things."

msgid "木材的事找我就對了，不過你得先讓我看看你的誠意。"
msgstr "For timber, I'm your man, but show me you're serious first."

msgid "發展的第一步"
msgstr "First step of growth"

msgid "有了基本生存條件，是時候考慮長遠發展了。"
msgstr "With the basics covered, it's time to think long term."

msgid "開啟產業，建立經濟基礎。"
msgstr "Open an industry and lay an economic foundation."

msgid "靠人脈和好名聲推動發展。"
msgstr "Drive growth through connections and reputation."

msgid "全鎮平均好感度達到 20"
msgstr "Town average affinity reaches 20"

msgid "與居民交談 15 次"
msgstr "Talk with residents 15 times"

msgid "產業開始運轉，你正式成為鎮上不可或缺的一份子。"
msgstr "Industry is running and you are officially indispensable to the town."

msgid "想賺錢的話，先選個產業做起來。我看好農業或伐木。"
msgstr "Want to make money? Pick an industry first. I'd bet on farming or logging."

msgid "穩定經濟"
msgstr "A stable economy"

msgid "小鎮需要一個穩定的經濟體系才能長久。"
msgstr "The town needs a stable economy to last."

msgid "經營路線"
msgstr "Business route"

msgid "透過貿易和產業建立經濟。"
msgstr "Build the economy through trade and industry."

msgid "完成 3 次交易"
msgstr "Complete 3 trades"

msgid "累積 100 銀幣"
msgstr "Accumulate 100 silver"

msgid "與多位 NPC 建立友誼，互助共榮。"
msgstr "Befriend several villagers and prosper together."

msgid "與 3 位 NPC 達到「朋友」關係"
msgstr "Become \"friends\" with 3 villagers"

msgid "大興土木，用建設帶動經濟。"
msgstr "Build big and let construction drive the economy."

msgid "完成 5 座建築"
msgstr "Complete 5 buildings"

msgid "人口達到 12 人"
msgstr "Population reaches 12"

msgid "小鎮的經濟開始走上正軌了。"
msgstr "The town's economy is on track."

msgid "我認識幾個商人，如果你跟我關係好，我可以幫你牽線。"
msgstr "I know a few merchants. Stay on my good side and I'll introduce you."

msgid "經濟不好的時候，農業最靠譜。我可以幫忙。"
msgstr "When times are hard, farming is the safest bet. I can help."

msgid "農耕之道"
msgstr "The way of farming"

msgid "民以食為天。建立農場，讓小鎮自給自足。"
msgstr "Food comes first. Build a farm and make the town self-sufficient."

msgid "務農路線"
msgstr "Farming route"

msgid "親自種植作物，完成收穫。"
msgstr "Grow crops yourself and bring in a harvest."

msgid "開啟農業產業"
msgstr "Open the farming industry"

msgid "完成 3 次收穫"
msgstr "Complete 3 harvests"

msgid "拜師路線"
msgstr "Apprentice route"

msgid "跟劉俊學種田，事半功倍。"
msgstr "Learn farming from Leo and get twice the results."

msgid "劉俊好感度達到 40"
msgstr "Reach 40 affinity with Leo"

msgid "完成 1 次收穫"
msgstr "Complete 1 harvest"

msgid "第一次豐收！農民們歡天喜地。"
msgstr "The first harvest! The farmers rejoice."

msgid "你對種田有興趣？來，我教你幾招。先從小麥開始最穩。"
msgstr "Interested in farming? Let me show you a few tricks. Start with wheat, it's the safest."

msgid "劉俊那小子種田很有一套，你可以去跟他請教。"
msgstr "That Leo really knows farming. Go ask him."

msgid "凝聚共識"
msgstr "Building consensus"

msgid "小鎮需要向心力。讓居民們感受到歸屬感。"
msgstr "The town needs unity. Give residents a sense of belonging."

msgid "人氣路線"
msgstr "Popularity route"

msgid "成為大家喜愛的人物。"
msgstr "Become someone everyone likes."

msgid "全鎮平均好感度達到 25"
msgstr "Town average affinity reaches 25"

msgid "人口達到 15 人"
msgstr "Population reaches 15"

msgid "發展路線"
msgstr "Development route"

msgid "用實力說話，讓小鎮更上一層樓。"
msgstr "Let results speak and take the town to the next level."

msgid "城鎮等級達到 Lv3（村莊）"
msgstr "Town level reaches Lv3 (Village)"

msgid "開啟 2 個產業"
msgstr "Open 2 industries"

msgid "小鎮的居民們已經把你當成自己人了。"
msgstr "The residents now count you as one of their own."

msgid "你做的事大家都看在眼裡。繼續加油，這個鎮需要你。"
msgstr "Everyone sees what you do. Keep it up, this town needs you."

msgid "人心齊，泰山移。多跟大家聊聊天，讓他們感受到溫暖。"
msgstr "United hearts move mountains. Talk with people and let them feel your warmth."

msgid "風暴來襲"
msgstr "The storm arrives"

msgid "一場突如其來的危機降臨小鎮。你必須帶領大家度過難關。"
msgstr "A sudden crisis hits the town. You must lead everyone through it."

msgid "武力路線"
msgstr "Force route"

msgid "靠武力和防禦正面迎擊。"
msgstr "Meet it head-on with force and defense."

msgid "楊鋒好感度達到 40"
msgstr "Reach 40 affinity with Felix"

msgid "成功抵禦入侵"
msgstr "Repel the raid"

msgid "智慧路線"
msgstr "Wisdom route"

msgid "用研究和知識找到對策。"
msgstr "Find a solution through research and knowledge."

msgid "孫雨好感度達到 40"
msgstr "Reach 40 affinity with Nora"

msgid "準備 200 銀幣研究經費"
msgstr "Prepare 200 silver in research funds"

msgid "靠商業人脈從外部取得援助。"
msgstr "Get outside help through trade connections."

msgid "趙霞好感度達到 40"
msgstr "Reach 40 affinity with Zoe"

msgid "完成 8 次交易"
msgstr "Complete 8 trades"

msgid "團結路線"
msgstr "Unity route"

msgid "團結全鎮之力，共同度過。"
msgstr "Unite the whole town and get through it together."

msgid "全鎮平均好感度達到 30"
msgstr "Town average affinity reaches 30"

msgid "與 5 位 NPC 達到「朋友」關係"
msgstr "Become \"friends\" with 5 villagers"

msgid "危機解除了！你的領導力讓小鎮度過了最艱難的時刻。"
msgstr "Crisis averted! Your leadership carried the town through its darkest hour."

msgid "如果你信得過我，我可以幫你組織防禦。但你得聽我的指揮。"
msgstr "If you trust me, I can organize the defense. But you follow my orders."

msgid "每個問題都有科學的解決方法。讓我研究一下，也許能找到突破口。"
msgstr "Every problem has a scientific solution. Let me research; maybe I'll find a breakthrough."

msgid "外面的人脈很重要。如果你需要援助，我可以幫你聯繫。"
msgstr "Outside connections matter. If you need aid, I can make contact."

msgid "大家都在看你怎麼做。不管選哪條路，團結是最重要的。"
msgstr "Everyone is watching you. Whatever path you choose, unity matters most."

msgid "重建家園"
msgstr "Rebuilding home"

msgid "危機過後，小鎮需要重建。趁這個機會讓它變得更好。"
msgstr "After the crisis, the town must rebuild. Use the chance to make it better."

msgid "大興土木，重建並擴建。"
msgstr "Build big: rebuild and expand."

msgid "完成 8 座建築"
msgstr "Complete 8 buildings"

msgid "建造 1 座工廠"
msgstr "Build 1 factory"

msgid "繁榮路線"
msgstr "Prosperity route"

msgid "用經濟實力快速恢復。"
msgstr "Recover quickly through economic strength."

msgid "累積 300 銀幣"
msgstr "Accumulate 300 silver"

msgid "完成 10 次交易"
msgstr "Complete 10 trades"

msgid "浴火重生的小鎮比以前更加堅強！"
msgstr "Reborn from the ashes, the town is stronger than ever!"

msgid "重建的事交給我吧！...好啦，我會認真的。"
msgstr "Leave the rebuilding to me! ...Okay, I'll take it seriously."

msgid "建材的事，我這邊有門路。"
msgstr "For building materials, I know a way."

msgid "小鎮擴張"
msgstr "Town expansion"

msgid "小鎮已經站穩腳跟。是時候向更高的目標邁進了。"
msgstr "The town stands firm. Time to aim higher."

msgid "多角化經營，產業全開。"
msgstr "Diversify and open every industry."

msgid "開啟 3 個產業"
msgstr "Open 3 industries"

msgid "城鎮等級達到 Lv5（城鎮）"
msgstr "Town level reaches Lv5 (Town)"

msgid "社群路線"
msgstr "Community route"

msgid "讓所有人都覺得這裡是家。"
msgstr "Make everyone feel this is home."

msgid "人口達到 20 人"
msgstr "Population reaches 20"

msgid "與 6 位 NPC 達到「朋友」關係"
msgstr "Become \"friends\" with 6 villagers"

msgid "小鎮的規模今非昔比，已經成為區域內的重要據點。"
msgstr "The town has grown beyond recognition into a key hub of the region."

msgid "這個鎮已經不小了。我們需要更正式的管理方式。"
msgstr "This town isn't small anymore. We need more formal governance."

msgid "民主之聲"
msgstr "Voice of democracy"

msgid "小鎮需要正式的領導人。參與這歷史性的一刻。"
msgstr "The town needs a formal leader. Be part of this historic moment."

msgid "選舉路線"
msgstr "Election route"

msgid "見證或參與選舉。"
msgstr "Witness or take part in an election."

msgid "經歷一次選舉"
msgstr "Live through an election"

msgid "威望路線"
msgstr "Prestige route"

msgid "靠威望獲得大家的信任。"
msgstr "Earn trust through prestige."

msgid "全鎮平均好感度達到 40"
msgstr "Town average affinity reaches 40"

msgid "聲望達到 80"
msgstr "Reputation reaches 80"

msgid "小鎮有了正式的領導人！民主的種子在邊境發芽了。"
msgstr "The town has a formal leader! The seed of democracy sprouts on the frontier."

msgid "深厚羈絆"
msgstr "Deep bonds"

msgid "經歷了這麼多，你和這裡的人建立了深厚的感情。"
msgstr "After all this, you and the people here share deep bonds."

msgid "摯友路線"
msgstr "Best friend route"

msgid "與某位居民建立深厚的友誼。"
msgstr "Build a deep friendship with one resident."

msgid "與某位居民好感度達到 70"
msgstr "Reach 70 affinity with any resident"

msgid "眾人路線"
msgstr "Beloved route"

msgid "成為人人愛戴的存在。"
msgstr "Be loved by everyone."

msgid "與 8 位 NPC 達到「朋友」關係"
msgstr "Become \"friends\" with 8 villagers"

msgid "全鎮平均好感度達到 35"
msgstr "Town average affinity reaches 35"

msgid "你在這裡找到了真正的歸屬。這些人不只是鄰居——是家人。"
msgstr "You found true belonging here. These people aren't just neighbors; they're family."

msgid "...謝謝你一直對我這麼好。你是我在鎮上最信任的人。"
msgstr "...Thank you for always being so good to me. You're the person I trust most in town."

msgid "欸，你是我最好的朋友，你知道吧？"
msgstr "Hey, you're my best friend, you know that?"

msgid "傳承"
msgstr "Legacy"

msgid "邊境鎮已經成為一個真正的家。為它寫下歷史吧。"
msgstr "Frontier Town has become a true home. Write its history."

msgid "讓小鎮成為遠近聞名的繁榮之地。"
msgstr "Make the town famous far and wide for its prosperity."

msgid "累積 500 銀幣"
msgstr "Accumulate 500 silver"

msgid "人口達到 25 人"
msgstr "Population reaches 25"

msgid "城鎮等級達到 Lv6（大城鎮）"
msgstr "Town level reaches Lv6 (Large Town)"

msgid "讓所有人和睦相處。"
msgstr "Let everyone live in harmony."

msgid "與 10 位 NPC 達到「朋友」關係"
msgstr "Become \"friends\" with 10 villagers"

msgid "完成所有挑戰，成為傳奇。"
msgstr "Complete every challenge and become a legend."

msgid "四大產業全開"
msgstr "All four industries open"

msgid "城鎮等級達到 Lv7（城市）"
msgstr "Town level reaches Lv7 (City)"

msgid "與某位居民好感度達到 80"
msgstr "Reach 80 affinity with any resident"

msgid "邊境鎮的傳奇故事將被世世代代傳頌。這是你書寫的歷史。"
msgstr "The legend of Frontier Town will be told for generations. This is the history you wrote."

msgid "王麗的私房菜"
msgstr "Lily's home cooking"

msgid "「嘿，新來的！你看起來瘦巴巴的。來，嚐嚐我的拿手菜。不過我缺一些食材...幫我找找？」王麗笑著遞給你一張紙條。"
msgstr "\"Hey, newcomer! You look skinny. Come try my specialty. But I'm short on ingredients... help me find some?\" Lily smiles and hands you a note."

msgid "幫王麗收集食材，品嚐她的私房菜。"
msgstr "Gather ingredients for Lily and taste her home cooking."

msgid "收集 30 份食材"
msgstr "Gather 30 ingredients"

msgid "和王麗好感度達 20"
msgstr "Reach 20 affinity with Lily"

msgid "王麗端出一桌好菜，整個酒館都飄著香氣。「怎麼樣？好吃吧？以後你就是我的常客了！」你感覺到了家的溫暖。"
msgstr "Lily lays out a feast and the whole tavern smells wonderful. \"Well? Good, right? You're my regular from now on!\" You feel the warmth of home."

msgid "我最近在研究一道新菜，需要一些特別的食材。你能幫忙嗎？"
msgstr "I'm working on a new dish and need some special ingredients. Can you help?"

msgid "鐵匠的心事"
msgstr "The blacksmith's secret"

msgid "你偶然發現張豪在工坊後面偷偷寫著什麼。他一看到你，慌忙把紙藏起來。「沒...沒什麼。」他的臉紅了。你注意到紙上寫的是一首詩。"
msgstr "You catch Hugo writing something behind the workshop. Seeing you, he hastily hides the paper. \"N-nothing.\" He blushes. You noticed it was a poem."

msgid "了解張豪的內心世界，幫助他找到表達自己的方式。"
msgstr "Understand Hugo's inner world and help him find a way to express himself."

msgid "和張豪好感度達 30"
msgstr "Reach 30 affinity with Hugo"

msgid "收集 20 金屬"
msgstr "Gather 20 metal"

msgid "張豪終於鼓起勇氣，把他的詩刻在了一件精美的鐵器上。「謝謝你...你是第一個知道我會寫詩的人。」他遞給你一把特製的工具作為謝禮。"
msgstr "Hugo finally finds the courage to engrave his poem on a fine piece of ironwork. \"Thank you... you're the first to know I write poetry.\" He hands you a custom tool as thanks."

msgid "...你不會覺得一個鐵匠寫詩很奇怪吧？"
msgstr "...You don't think a blacksmith writing poetry is weird, do you?"

msgid "劉俊在田邊嘆氣，手裡攥著一封信。「你...你覺得一個農夫配得上她嗎？」他小聲問你。你看到信封上寫著許瑩的名字。"
msgstr "Leo sighs at the edge of the field, clutching a letter. \"Do you... think a farmer is good enough for her?\" he asks quietly. The envelope bears Ivy's name."

msgid "幫助劉俊鼓起勇氣，送出他的情書。"
msgstr "Help Leo find the courage to deliver his love letter."

msgid "和劉俊好感度達 25"
msgstr "Reach 25 affinity with Leo"

msgid "和許瑩好感度達 15"
msgstr "Reach 15 affinity with Ivy"

msgid "在你的鼓勵下，劉俊終於把信交給了許瑩。許瑩讀完後，臉紅得像夕陽一樣。「笨蛋...你早該說的。」她小聲說。劉俊傻傻地笑了。"
msgstr "With your encouragement, Leo finally gives Ivy the letter. She reads it and blushes like the sunset. \"Dummy... you should have said so sooner,\" she whispers. Leo grins like a fool."

msgid "我...我有一封信想交給某個人。但我怕被拒絕。"
msgstr "I... have a letter for someone. But I'm afraid of being rejected."

msgid "最近劉俊好像一直在看我...是我想多了嗎？"
msgstr "Leo seems to keep looking at me lately... am I imagining it?"

msgid "古代遺跡之謎"
msgstr "Mystery of the ancient ruins"

msgid "孫雨興奮地跑來找你：「我在鎮外發現了古代遺跡的入口！裡面可能藏著這片土地的秘密。但我一個人不敢進去...你願意陪我嗎？」"
msgstr "Nora runs up excitedly: \"I found the entrance to ancient ruins outside town! The land's secrets may be inside. But I don't dare go alone... will you come with me?\""

msgid "和孫雨一起探索古代遺跡，揭開邊境鎮的歷史。"
msgstr "Explore the ruins with Nora and uncover Frontier Town's history."

msgid "和孫雨好感度達 35"
msgstr "Reach 35 affinity with Nora"

msgid "準備 80 銀幣的探險經費"
msgstr "Prepare 80 silver for the expedition"

msgid "你和孫雨在遺跡中發現了一面石碑，上面記載著邊境鎮數百年前曾是一個繁華的驛站。「原來這裡曾經這麼輝煌...」孫雨的眼睛閃著光，「也許我們能讓它重現往日的榮光。」"
msgstr "In the ruins you and Nora find a stele recording that centuries ago Frontier Town was a thriving waystation. \"It was once so glorious...\" Nora's eyes shine. \"Maybe we can bring that glory back.\""

msgid "鎮外的那些石頭不是普通的石頭，那是古代建築的遺跡！我需要幫手。"
msgstr "Those stones outside town aren't ordinary stones, they're ruins of ancient buildings! I need a helper."

msgid "一天晚上，吳達在酒館裡喝得醉醺醺的，突然說：「你知道嗎...我年輕的時候，差點把整個礦坑炸了。」他的眼中閃過一絲愧疚。"
msgstr "One night at the tavern, a very drunk Duncan blurts out: \"You know... when I was young, I nearly blew up the whole mine.\" A flicker of guilt crosses his eyes."

msgid "聆聽吳達的過去，幫助他放下心中的包袱。"
msgstr "Listen to Duncan's past and help him set down his burden."

msgid "和吳達好感度達 40"
msgstr "Reach 40 affinity with Duncan"

msgid "開採 60 石料（證明你理解他的工作）"
msgstr "Mine 60 stone (prove you understand his work)"

msgid "吳達終於說出了全部的故事——年輕時因為疏忽導致礦坑事故，兩個同伴受傷。他來邊境鎮就是為了贖罪。「謝謝你聽我說這些...我覺得輕鬆多了。」老礦工第一次露出了笑容。"
msgstr "Duncan finally tells the whole story: a careless mistake in his youth caused a mine accident that injured two companions. He came to Frontier Town to atone. \"Thank you for listening... I feel so much lighter.\" The old miner smiles for the first time."

msgid "...算了，你不會想聽一個老頭子的嘮叨。"
msgstr "...Never mind, you don't want to hear an old man ramble."

msgid "黃莉的歌聲"
msgstr "Hazel's song"

msgid "「你有沒有聽過邊境鎮的古老歌謠？」黃莉在教堂門口問你。「聽說以前每年豐收節，全鎮的人都會一起唱。要不要幫我恢復這個傳統？」"
msgstr "\"Have you heard Frontier Town's old folk song?\" Hazel asks at the chapel door. \"They say the whole town used to sing it every Harvest Festival. Help me revive the tradition?\""

msgid "幫助黃莉組織一場音樂會，凝聚鎮民的心。"
msgstr "Help Hazel organize a concert to bring the town together."

msgid "和黃莉好感度達 30"
msgstr "Reach 30 affinity with Hazel"

msgid "鎮上至少有 13 位居民"
msgstr "At least 13 residents in town"

msgid "全鎮平均好感度至少 15"
msgstr "Town average affinity at least 15"

msgid "在黃莉的帶領下，整個小鎮的人聚在廣場上，一起唱著古老的豐收歌。有人笑，有人哭。這一刻，所有人都感受到了歸屬感。你看到陳偉偷偷擦了擦眼角。"
msgstr "Led by Hazel, the whole town gathers in the square to sing the old harvest song. Some laugh, some cry. In this moment everyone feels they belong. You see Victor quietly wipe his eyes."

msgid "我在整理教堂時找到了一本很舊的歌譜。想不想聽我唱幾首？"
msgstr "I found a very old songbook while tidying the chapel. Want to hear a few?"

msgid "楊鋒的戰爭記憶"
msgstr "Felix's memories of war"

msgid "危機當前，楊鋒比任何人都緊張。你發現他半夜一個人在城牆上，盯著遠方。「我以前打過仗，」他低聲說，「我知道戰爭是什麼樣子。我不想讓這裡的人經歷那些...」"
msgstr "With crisis looming, Felix is tenser than anyone. You find him alone on the wall at midnight, staring into the distance. \"I fought in a war,\" he says quietly. \"I know what it looks like. I don't want these people to go through that...\""

msgid "了解楊鋒的過去，幫助他面對內心的恐懼。"
msgstr "Learn Felix's past and help him face his fear."

msgid "和楊鋒好感度達 50"
msgstr "Reach 50 affinity with Felix"

msgid "和陳偉好感度達 30（兩個老兵互相理解）"
msgstr "Reach 30 affinity with Victor (two veterans understand each other)"

msgid "你把陳偉帶到楊鋒身邊。兩個曾經的軍人，第一次坦誠地聊起了戰爭的記憶。「我們不是為了打仗才來這裡的，」陳偉拍拍楊鋒的肩膀，「我們是為了保護要保護的人。」楊鋒的眼眶紅了，但背脊挺得更直了。"
msgstr "You bring Victor to Felix. Two former soldiers speak openly of war for the first time. \"We didn't come here to fight,\" Victor says, clapping Felix's shoulder. \"We came to protect the people we need to protect.\" Felix's eyes redden, but he stands straighter."

msgid "你有沒有失去過重要的人？...算了，當我沒問。"
msgstr "Have you ever lost someone important? ...Never mind, forget I asked."

msgid "趙霞的人脈"
msgstr "Zoe's connections"

msgid "趙霞緊皺著眉頭在翻她的帳本。「外面的局勢比我想的嚴峻...不過我還有幾張底牌。」她抬頭看你，「要不要跟我一起跑一趟商路？」"
msgstr "Zoe frowns over her ledger. \"Things outside are worse than I thought... but I still have a few cards to play.\" She looks up. \"Want to run a trade route with me?\""

msgid "和趙霞一起拓展商業網絡，為小鎮爭取外援。"
msgstr "Expand the trade network with Zoe and secure outside aid."

msgid "和趙霞好感度達 45"
msgstr "Reach 45 affinity with Zoe"

msgid "完成 5 次交易"
msgstr "Complete 5 trades"

msgid "趙霞成功聯繫上了遠方的商會。「以後不管發生什麼事，我們都有退路了。」她少見地露出安心的表情。然後她轉頭對你說：「你知道嗎？你是我第一個信任的合夥人。」"
msgstr "Zoe makes contact with a distant merchant guild. \"Whatever happens now, we have a way out.\" A rare look of relief. Then she turns to you: \"You know? You're the first partner I've ever trusted.\""

msgid "做生意最重要的是人脈。我可以帶你認識幾個有用的人。"
msgstr "In business, connections are everything. Let me introduce you to a few useful people."

msgid "浪子回頭"
msgstr "The prodigal returns"

msgid "馬強最近變得不太一樣。他不再整天吹牛，而是認真地待在工坊裡。「我想替鎮上蓋一座真正的地標，」他說，「證明我不只是個嘴砲。」"
msgstr "Max has changed lately. No more bragging all day; he stays in the workshop working hard. \"I want to build a real landmark for the town,\" he says. \"Prove I'm not all talk.\""

msgid "支持馬強的改變，幫他建造一座地標建築。"
msgstr "Support Max's change and help him build a landmark."

msgid "和馬強好感度達 40"
msgstr "Reach 40 affinity with Max"

msgid "鎮上建築達 10 座"
msgstr "10 buildings in town"

msgid "準備 100 木材"
msgstr "Prepare 100 wood"

msgid "馬強花了整整三天三夜，建造出一座精美的鐘塔。全鎮的人都來圍觀。「我這輩子第一次把一件事做到最好。」他看著自己的作品，眼角有些濕潤。王麗遞給他一碗熱湯：「吃吧，大藝術家。」"
msgstr "Max works three days and nights and raises a beautiful clock tower. The whole town comes to see. \"First time in my life I've done something perfectly.\" His eyes are damp as he looks at it. Lily hands him a bowl of hot soup: \"Eat, great artist.\""

msgid "你信不信，我其實是個天才木匠？...好啦，至少我想成為一個。"
msgstr "Believe it or not, I'm actually a genius carpenter. ...Okay, at least I want to be one."

msgid "許瑩的夢想"
msgstr "Ivy's dream"

msgid "你在許瑩的工坊裡看到一件華麗的禮服——但只完成了一半。「這是...我夢想中的作品。」她小聲說，「但我怕做不好，會被大家笑。」"
msgstr "In Ivy's workshop you see a gorgeous gown, only half finished. \"That's... my dream piece,\" she says softly. \"But I'm afraid I'll do it badly and everyone will laugh.\""

msgid "鼓勵許瑩完成她的夢想之作。"
msgstr "Encourage Ivy to finish her dream creation."

msgid "和許瑩好感度達 50"
msgstr "Reach 50 affinity with Ivy"

msgid "收集 40 布料"
msgstr "Gather 40 cloth"

msgid "在你的支持下，許瑩完成了她的傑作。當她怯怯地把禮服展示給大家時，全場安靜了三秒——然後爆發出熱烈的掌聲。許瑩哭了，但這次是開心的眼淚。「謝謝你相信我...」"
msgstr "With your support, Ivy finishes her masterpiece. When she shyly shows the gown, the room falls silent for three seconds, then erupts in applause. Ivy cries, happy tears this time. \"Thank you for believing in me...\""

msgid "我有一件很重要的作品...但我還沒有勇氣完成它。"
msgstr "I have a very important piece... but I haven't found the courage to finish it."

msgid "老鎮長的心願"
msgstr "The old mayor's wish"

msgid "陳偉找到你，罕見地露出疲憊的表情。「我老了...這個鎮已經不需要我這樣的人了。」他望著窗外，「但在我交出這個位置之前，我想做最後一件事——寫一部邊境鎮的歷史。你願意幫我嗎？」"
msgstr "Victor finds you, looking unusually weary. \"I'm old... this town doesn't need someone like me anymore.\" He gazes out the window. \"But before I hand over this post, I want to do one last thing: write a history of Frontier Town. Will you help me?\""

msgid "幫助陳偉完成邊境鎮的歷史紀錄，讓後人銘記。"
msgstr "Help Victor finish the history of Frontier Town so future generations remember."

msgid "和陳偉好感度達 60"
msgstr "Reach 60 affinity with Victor"

msgid "聲望達到 60"
msgstr "Reputation reaches 60"

msgid "至少和 6 位居民成為朋友"
msgstr "Befriend at least 6 residents"

msgid "陳偉在最後一頁寫道：「...在這位旅人到來之後，邊境鎮真正活了過來。」他合上書，遞給你。「這本書是鎮上所有人的故事，但你是最重要的那一章。」你翻開扉頁，看到每一位居民都簽上了自己的名字。"
msgstr "On the last page Victor writes: \"...after this traveler arrived, Frontier Town truly came alive.\" He closes the book and hands it to you. \"This book is everyone's story, but you are the most important chapter.\" You open the flyleaf and find every resident has signed their name."

msgid "你知道嗎？我來這裡已經二十年了。有時候我會想...這一切值不值得。"
msgstr "You know, I've been here twenty years. Sometimes I wonder... whether it was all worth it."

msgid "和一位居民聊聊天"
msgstr "Chat with a resident"

msgid "儲備 20 份食物"
msgstr "Stockpile 20 food"

msgid "收集 15 份木材"
msgstr "Gather 15 wood"

msgid "讓一位居民對你好感超過 10"
msgstr "Get a resident's affinity above 10"

msgid "完成一次收穫"
msgstr "Complete a harvest"

msgid "完成一次交易"
msgstr "Complete a trade"

msgid "累計聊天達 5 次"
msgstr "Chat 5 times in total"

msgid "累積 50 銀幣"
msgstr "Accumulate 50 silver"

msgid "開啟一個新產業"
msgstr "Open a new industry"

msgid "擁有至少 3 位朋友"
msgstr "Have at least 3 friends"

msgid "全鎮平均好感度達 25"
msgstr "Town average affinity reaches 25"

msgid "第一個夜晚"
msgstr "The first night"

msgid "夜幕降臨，你獨自坐在酒館門口。遠處傳來蟲鳴和偶爾的犬吠。王麗端了一碗熱湯出來：「喝吧，新來的。邊境鎮的夜晚很冷的。」你喝了一口，暖意從胃裡蔓延到全身。也許...這裡不算太糟。"
msgstr "Night falls and you sit alone outside the tavern. Crickets chirp; a dog barks somewhere. Lily brings out a bowl of hot soup: \"Drink up, newcomer. Nights are cold in Frontier Town.\" You take a sip and warmth spreads from your stomach through your whole body. Maybe... this place isn't so bad."

msgid "第一個朋友"
msgstr "The first friend"

msgid "你發現有人開始主動跟你打招呼了——不再是禮貌性的點頭，而是真心的微笑。在這個偏遠的邊境小鎮，你交到了第一個朋友。原來被人接納的感覺，是這麼的好。"
msgstr "People have started greeting you first, not with polite nods but with real smiles. In this remote frontier town, you've made your first friend. So this is what being accepted feels like."

msgid "第一次豐收"
msgstr "The first harvest"

msgid "看著田裡金黃的麥穗隨風搖曳，你第一次理解了劉俊對土地的熱愛。「這就是我留在這裡的原因，」他站在你身邊，驕傲地說，「你種下的每一顆種子，都是對未來的承諾。」"
msgstr "Watching golden wheat sway in the wind, you understand Leo's love for the land for the first time. \"This is why I stay,\" he says proudly at your side. \"Every seed you plant is a promise to the future.\""

msgid "小鎮漸成"
msgstr "A town takes shape"

msgid "站在高處眺望，你發現小鎮不知不覺已經有了規模。新來的住戶正在搬家，孩子們在街上奔跑，商人們在廣場上討價還價。陳偉走到你身邊：「你看，這就是我們一起建造的。」他的語氣中帶著自豪。"
msgstr "From high ground you see the town has quietly grown. New residents are moving in, children run in the streets, merchants haggle in the square. Victor comes to your side: \"Look. We built this together.\" There is pride in his voice."

msgid "風雨欲來"
msgstr "Storm on the horizon"

msgid "天邊烏雲密佈，鎮上的氣氛變得凝重。你看到楊鋒在磨刀，吳達在加固礦道，林美在準備草藥。每個人都在用自己的方式做準備。陳偉拍了拍你的肩膀：「不管發生什麼，我們一起面對。」"
msgstr "Dark clouds mass on the horizon and the mood in town turns grave. Felix sharpens his blade, Duncan shores up the mine, Mia prepares herbs. Everyone readies in their own way. Victor claps your shoulder: \"Whatever comes, we face it together.\""

msgid "廢墟中的希望"
msgstr "Hope among the ruins"

msgid "危機過後，小鎮滿目瘡痍。但你看到黃莉在廢墟中唱歌，馬強已經在丈量重建的尺寸，王麗架起臨時的鍋灶煮飯。「沒什麼好怕的，」趙霞理了理頭髮，「重建也是一種商機嘛。」你笑了。這些人，才是邊境鎮真正的寶藏。"
msgstr "After the crisis the town lies battered. But Hazel sings among the rubble, Max is already measuring for the rebuild, Lily sets up a makeshift stove. \"Nothing to fear,\" Zoe says, fixing her hair. \"Rebuilding is a business opportunity too.\" You smile. These people are Frontier Town's real treasure."

msgid "你是我們的一份子"
msgstr "One of us"

msgid "今天有人叫你「我們的人」而不是「那個旅人」。你在酒館裡坐著，四周是熟悉的面孔和笑聲。不知道從什麼時候開始，這裡不再是暫時的落腳處——這裡已經是你的家了。"
msgstr "Today someone called you \"one of ours\" instead of \"that traveler\". You sit in the tavern surrounded by familiar faces and laughter. Somewhere along the way this stopped being a temporary stop. This is your home now."

msgid "支線任務解鎖"
msgstr "Side quest unlocked"

msgid "支線獎勵"
msgstr "Side quest reward"

msgid "支線任務完成"
msgstr "Side quest complete"

msgid "每日目標獎勵"
msgstr "Daily goal reward"

msgid "每日目標完成"
msgstr "Daily goal complete"

msgid "主線任務完成"
msgstr "Main quest complete"

msgid "新任務解鎖"
msgstr "New quest unlocked"

msgid "危機降臨"
msgstr "Crisis strikes"

msgid "重大危機"
msgstr "Major crisis"

msgid "威脅著小鎮的生存"
msgstr " threatens the town's survival"

msgid "支線"
msgstr "Side quest"

msgid "可選路線"
msgstr "Optional route"

msgid "玩家正在進行的任務"
msgstr "Quests the player is working on"

msgid "蝗災正在侵襲小鎮，農作物受到嚴重威脅。大家都很擔心糧食問題。"
