msgstr "Bandits prowl near the town and safety is at risk. Residents are on edge."

msgid "一種神秘的疾病在小鎮蔓延，已有多人生病。大家急需醫療資源。"
msgstr "A mysterious illness is spreading through town and several people are sick. Medical supplies are urgently needed."

