msgstr "👤 Residents on the move — they work, socialize, eat and sleep on their own"

msgid "🌙 日夜交替 —— 白天工作，傍晚社交，深夜休息"
msgstr "🌙 Day and night — work by day, socialize at dusk, rest at night"

