msgstr "Walk up to a villager with the arrow keys / joystick and press \"Talk\", or open <strong>Chat</strong> (mobile: 💬 at the bottom) and pick someone. They reply based on personality, mood and affinity."

msgid "💕 好感度高的居民會更友善"
msgstr "💕 Residents with high affinity are friendlier"

msgid "💼 你可以選擇自己的職業"
