msgid "💒 你甚至可以和居民約會、求婚！"
msgstr "💒 You can even date and propose to residents!"

msgid "<strong>經濟</strong>（手機：☰ 選單→經濟）可以查看資源、建築、科技樹和貿易。"
msgstr "<strong>Economy</strong> (mobile: ☰ menu → Economy) shows resources, buildings, the tech tree and trade."

msgid "<strong>經濟→產業</strong> 子分頁管理農場種植、工廠加工和產業發展。"
msgstr "The <strong>Economy → Industry</strong> sub-tab manages farming, factory processing and industry growth."

msgid "🌾 種植作物、收穫農產品"
msgstr "🌾 Plant crops and harvest produce"

msgid "🏭 建造工廠加工原料"
msgstr "🏭 Build factories to process raw materials"

msgid "📈 隨著人口增長，城鎮等級提升"
msgstr "📈 The town levels up as the population grows"

msgid "⚔️ 完成任務獲得獎勵"
msgstr "⚔️ Complete quests for rewards"

msgid "🗳️ 鎮長選舉 —— 投票選出你支持的候選人"
msgstr "🗳️ Mayoral elections — vote for the candidate you back"

msgid "⚔️ 盜匪襲擊 —— 守衛和居民會奮力防禦"
msgstr "⚔️ Bandit raids — guards and residents fight to defend the town"

msgid "🎪 季節慶典 —— 春祭、仲夏篝火、豐收節、冬至"
msgstr "🎪 Seasonal festivals — Spring Rite, Midsummer Bonfire, Harvest Festival, Winter Solstice"

msgid "🗺️ 探索系統 —— 派遣探險隊探索鎮外區域"
msgstr "🗺️ Exploration — send expeditions beyond the town"

msgid "🗞️ AI 日報 —— 村莊記者會報導鎮上的大小事"
msgstr "🗞️ AI Daily — the village reporter covers everything that happens"

msgid "不想註冊？先體驗一下也行！"
msgstr "Not ready to sign up? Try it first!"

msgid "🎮 訪客試玩"
msgstr "🎮 Play as guest"

msgid "存檔僅保留在本機，註冊後可同步到雲端"
msgstr "Saves stay on this device; sign up to sync to the cloud"

msgid "&#9650; 返回地圖"
msgstr "&#9650; Back to map"

msgid "提示：村民對話由內建 AI 生成，不需要設定任何金鑰；走到村民身邊按「交談」就能開聊。"
msgstr "Tip: villager dialogue is generated by the built-in AI, no keys needed; walk up to a villager and press \"Talk\" to start."

msgid "靜音"
msgstr "Mute"

msgid "玩家附近發生對話"
msgstr "A chat starts near the player"

msgid "組提示詞"
msgstr "Build the prompt"

msgid "快車道 Groq"
msgstr "Fast lane: Groq"

msgid "失敗就換 Claude 接手"
msgstr "On failure Claude takes over"

msgid "守門：拒答／洩漏／簡體"
msgstr "Gate: refusals / leaks / Simplified"

msgid "寫回記憶與關係"
msgstr "Write back memory and relations"

msgid "身分行"
msgstr "Identity line"

msgid "「你是某某，對面是來到鎮上的旅人，不是鎮長；現任鎮長是誰」——避免叫錯人"
msgstr "\"You are X; the person in front of you is a traveler who came to town, not the mayor; the current mayor is Y\" so nobody gets the wrong title"

msgid "抽出的記憶"
msgstr "Retrieved memories"

msgid "用時近×相關×重要度挑出最該想起的 3 到 6 條，不是整本翻"
msgstr "Recency × relevance × importance picks the 3 to 6 most recallable ones, never the whole book"

msgid "關係數字"
msgstr "Relationship numbers"

msgid "對這個人的好感、信任、心動，以及目前的稱呼（朋友／對手／暗戀）"
msgstr "Affinity, trust and attraction toward this person, plus the current label (friend / rival / crush)"

msgid "今天的計畫"
msgstr "Today's plan"

msgid "清晨排好的行程與現在正在做的事，讓對話有上下文"
msgstr "The schedule set at dawn and what they are doing right now, so the chat has context"

msgid "性格與心情"
msgstr "Personality and mood"

msgid "三個特質、價值觀、當下心情與最近的想法"
msgstr "Three traits, values, current mood and recent thoughts"

msgid "輸出格式"
msgstr "Output format"

msgid "只准輸出台詞與 EFFECTS 行（好感／心動／記憶變動），不准前言、分析、免責聲明"
msgstr "Only lines of dialogue plus EFFECTS rows (affinity / attraction / memory deltas); no preamble, analysis or disclaimers"

msgid "快車道 chat"
msgstr "Fast lane: chat"

msgid "玩家附近的即時對話"
msgstr "Live conversations near the player"

msgid "Groq（開源模型）"
msgstr "Groq (open model)"

msgid "Claude"
msgstr "Claude"

msgid "慢車道 background"
msgstr "Slow lane: background"

msgid "每日行程、深度反思、八卦與劇情"
msgstr "Daily schedules, deep reflection, gossip and drama"

msgid "Groq"
msgstr "Groq"

msgid "兩條路共用一個 26 秒預算（無伺服器函式上限 30 秒），第一條用掉多少，第二條就只剩多少。"
msgstr "Both routes share one 26-second budget (the serverless limit is 30 s); whatever the first route spends, the second has less."

msgid "逾時、限流（429）、伺服器錯誤：那條路冷卻。Groq 依回傳的重試時間冷卻，最短 5 分鐘；Claude 每失敗一次冷卻多 60 秒，上限 5 分鐘，成功即解除。"
msgstr "Timeout, rate limit (429) or server error cools that route down. Groq cools for its returned retry-after, at least 5 minutes; Claude adds 60 s per failure up to 5 minutes and clears on success."

msgid "回空白或拒絕扮演不算那條路壞掉，不冷卻，只是這一次換人。"
msgstr "An empty reply or a refusal to roleplay is not a broken route: no cooldown, just a swap for this one request."

msgid "每次回應都帶著 provider、lane、model 與 fallback_from，出問題可以直接從紀錄看出是哪一段接手的。"
msgstr "Every response carries provider, lane, model and fallback_from, so logs show exactly which route took over."

msgid "每次 Groq 回應都會讀 x-ratelimit 標頭，記下剩餘 token、剩餘請求數與重置時間。"
msgstr "Every Groq response is read for x-ratelimit headers: remaining tokens, remaining requests and reset time."

msgid "下一次請求先估算要用多少：中文每字算 1 token，其他每 4 個字元算 1，再加輸出上限（至少 160）與 50 的緩衝。"
msgstr "The next request is estimated first: 1 token per CJK character, 1 per 4 characters otherwise, plus the output cap (at least 160) and a 50-token buffer."

msgid "估算超過剩餘額度就直接跳過 Groq 改走 Claude，不會撞到 429 才發現。"
msgstr "If the estimate exceeds what is left, Groq is skipped for Claude up front instead of discovering it with a 429."

msgid "推理型模型（gpt-oss）固定輸出下限 160 token、推理強度 low、隱藏推理過程，避免它「想太久」回空白。"
msgstr "Reasoning models (gpt-oss) get a 160-token output floor, low reasoning effort and hidden reasoning, so they do not think too long and return nothing."

msgid "系統指示寫死：一律繁體中文（台灣用語）、不准自報 AI 身分、不准拒絕扮演、不准加前言。"
msgstr "The system instruction is fixed: Traditional Chinese (Taiwan usage) only, never claim to be an AI, never refuse to roleplay, no preamble."

msgid "回覆若出現「I'm Kiro / I am an AI / not designed for roleplay」這類句型，視同失敗，換另一條路重打。"
msgstr "A reply containing patterns like \"I'm Kiro / I am an AI / not designed for roleplay\" counts as a failure and is retried on the other route."

msgid "伺服器端先做簡轉繁（OpenCC 台灣用語），前端再掃一次；載入舊存檔時也會把殘留的簡體與洩漏句清掉。"
msgstr "The server converts Simplified to Traditional first (OpenCC, Taiwan usage), the client scans again, and loading an old save scrubs leftover Simplified text and leaked lines."

msgid "每位村民 500 條記憶上限，對話結束後只把「他會記住的那句話」寫進去，重要度 4 到 8。"
msgstr "Each villager holds up to 500 memories; after a chat only the line they would remember is written, importance 4 to 8."

msgid "只有玩家附近的村民才會呼叫 AI 對話，遠處的走規則式模板，但一樣寫進記憶、一樣影響好感。"
msgstr "Only villagers near the player call the AI for dialogue; distant ones use rule-based templates but still write memories and shift affinity."

msgid "每天有 AI 額度：行程一批打包成一次請求（每人約 450 token），深度反思每天最多 3 位。"
msgstr "There is a daily AI budget: schedules are batched into one request (about 450 tokens per villager) and deep reflection covers at most 3 villagers a day."

msgid "Groq 免費層大約每分鐘 30 次、每天 1,000 次、每分鐘 8,000 token；超過就自動改走付費的 Claude，玩家不會感覺到斷線。"
msgstr "The Groq free tier allows roughly 30 requests a minute, 1,000 a day and 8,000 tokens a minute; beyond that traffic moves to paid Claude with no visible interruption."

msgid "想看更深的技術細節：一次 AI 請求的旅程、兩個 AI 怎麼協作"
msgstr "Deeper technical details: the journey of one AI request, and how the two AIs cooperate"

msgid "提示詞怎麼組"
msgstr "How the prompt is assembled"

msgid "一次對話只打一個請求，裡面把村民「此刻腦子裡的東西」全部塞進去："
msgstr "One conversation is one request, packed with everything currently in the villager's head:"

msgid "兩條車道：誰先上"
msgstr "Two lanes: who goes first"

