msgstr "Limits"

msgid "即時對話要快，所以先問回應最快的 Groq；行程與反思要寫得細，所以先問 Claude。兩邊互為備援。"
msgstr "Live chat must be fast, so the quickest responder Groq goes first; schedules and reflection need detail, so Claude goes first. Each backs up the other."

msgid "互相接手與冷卻"
msgstr "Handoff and cooldown"

