msgstr "All API keys live in server environment variables, never in the client or in saves; players neither need nor can enter their own keys."

msgid "本機備份空間不足"
msgstr "Local backup storage is full"

msgid "存檔已改為只存雲端，進度安全。"
msgstr "Saves now go to the cloud only; your progress is safe."

